abstract: >-
  Analysis code, GBD Results Tool query definitions, and derived result tables
  for a systematic analysis of early-onset cancer (ages 15–49) and its
  metabolic-risk-attributable fraction using GBD 2023 (release 8352), with an
  external benchmark against GLOBOCAN 2024. Raw GBD and GLOBOCAN extracts are
  not redistributed; derived tables are released under CC BY 4.0.
